{"id": "17-3010-2-9", "zh": "ṭhā 这个词根可以替换为 tiṭṭha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3010-10-16", "zh": "这里的 vā 一词表示有定的任选（vavatthitavibhāsā）；a 词缀脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3010-17-20", "zh": "tiṭṭhati，tiṭṭhanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3010-21-24", "zh": "ṭhāti，ṭhanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3010-25-45", "zh": "a 词缀不脱落时，依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，在 ṭhā 之后增加 ha 音，并且元音变短；以 saṃ 为前缀时：saṇṭhahati，saṇṭhahanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3010-46-51", "zh": "变为 e 时：adhiṭṭheti，adhiṭṭhenti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3011-2-3", "zh": "在被动语态（kamma）中：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3012-2-13", "zh": "493. 在 ya 之前，dā、dhā、mā、ṭhā、hā、pā、maha、matha 等的末音变为 ī。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3013-2-20", "zh": "在动作语态（bhāva）与被动语态的范围内，当 ya 词缀在后时，dā、dhā、mā、ṭhā、hā、pā、maha、matha 等词根的末音变为 ī 音；这条规则是为必然适用而设的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3013-21-24", "zh": "upaṭṭhīyati，upaṭṭhīyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3013-25-35", "zh": "增加 ha 音时元音变短，并增加 ī 音：patiṭṭhahīyati，patiṭṭhahīyanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3013-36-38", "zh": "在动作语态中：ṭhīyate。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3014-2-6", "zh": "同样：tiṭṭhatu，tiṭṭhantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3014-7-10", "zh": "ṭhātu，ṭhantu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-11-14", "zh": "saṇṭhahatu，saṇṭhahantu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-15-18", "zh": "tiṭṭhe，tiṭṭheyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-19-24", "zh": "saṇṭhe，saṇṭheyya，saṇṭheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-25-28", "zh": "saṇṭhahe，saṇṭhaheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-29-32", "zh": "aṭṭhāsi，aṭṭhaṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-33-36", "zh": "saṇṭhahi，saṇṭhahiṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-37-40", "zh": "pakiṭṭhissati，patiṭṭhissanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3014-41-44", "zh": "ṭhassati，ṭhassanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-45-48", "zh": "patiṭṭhahissati，patiṭṭhahissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-49-52", "zh": "patiṭṭhissa，patiṭṭhissaṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3014-53-57", "zh": "patiṭṭhahissa，patiṭṭhahissaṃsu，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3015-2-12", "zh": "pā 意为“喝”；“vā”一词延续到下文。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3016-2-8", "zh": "494. pā 变为 piba。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3017-2-9", "zh": "pā 这个词根可以替换为 piba。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3017-10-13", "zh": "这里的 vā 一词表示有定的任选。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3018-2-3", "zh": "pibati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-4-5", "zh": "pibatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-6-7", "zh": "pibeyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-8-23", "zh": "依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，b 音变为 v 音：pivati，pivanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3018-24-30", "zh": "pāti，pānti，或 panti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3018-31-34", "zh": "pīyate，pīyante。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-35-38", "zh": "pīyati，pīyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-39-40", "zh": "pivatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-41-42", "zh": "piveyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-43-46", "zh": "apāyi，pivi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-47-48", "zh": "pivissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3018-49-51", "zh": "apivissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3019-2-12", "zh": "asa 意为“存在”；生起词尾，a 词缀脱落，在这里 asa 之后——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3020-2-12", "zh": "“asasmā”与“antalopo”也延续到下文。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3021-2-7", "zh": "495. ti 变为 tthi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3022-2-16", "zh": "在 asa 这个词根**之后的** ti 词尾变为 tthi，词根的末音也脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3022-17-18", "zh": "atthi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3023-2-9", "zh": "“vā”一词延续到下文。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3024-2-8", "zh": "496. 在一切情况下，asa 的首音也脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3025-2-16", "zh": "在所有词尾和词缀之前，asa 这个词根的首音可以脱落；这里的 vā 一词表示有定的任选。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3025-17-18", "zh": "santi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3026-2-12", "zh": "“asasmā”与“antalopo”也是管辖条（adhikāra）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3027-2-7", "zh": "497. 在 si 之前也是如此。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3028-2-9", "zh": "在 si 词尾之前，asa 词根的末音也脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3028-10-12", "zh": "tvaṃ asi（你是）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3029-2-8", "zh": "498. tha 变为 ttha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3030-2-16", "zh": "在 asa 这个词根之后的 tha 词尾变为 ttha，词根的末音也脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3030-17-19", "zh": "tumhe attha（你们是）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3031-2-9", "zh": "“vā”一词延续到下文。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3032-2-9", "zh": "499. 在 asa 之后，mi、ma 变为 mhi、mha，末音也脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3033-2-19", "zh": "在 asa 这个词根之后的 mi、ma 这两个词尾可以替换为 mhi、mha，词根的末音也脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3033-20-23", "zh": "amhi，amha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3033-24-27", "zh": "asmi，asma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3034-2-7", "zh": "500. tu 变为 tthu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3035-2-16", "zh": "在 asa 这个词根之后的 tu 词尾变为 tthu，词根的末音也脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3035-17-18", "zh": "atthu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3035-19-24", "zh": "asa 的首音也脱落：santu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3035-25-28", "zh": "āhi，attha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3035-29-32", "zh": "asmi，asma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3036-2-20", "zh": "在愿望式（sattamī）中，asa 的首音脱落；依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，asa 之后的 eyya、eyyuṃ 词尾变为 iyā、iyuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3036-21-24", "zh": "siyā，siyuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3037-2-23", "zh": "首音不脱落时，依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，asa 之后的 eyyā 等词尾连同词根末音一起替换为 ssa、ssu、ssa、ssatha、ssaṃ、ssāma。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3038-2-7", "zh": "例如 evamassa vacanīyo（应当这样对他说）；assu。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-3038-8-11", "zh": "assa，assatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3038-12-15", "zh": "assaṃ，assāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3039-2-14", "zh": "在不定过去时（ajjatanī）中，增加 a 音，并且变为长音：āsi，āsiṃsu，āsuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3039-15-18", "zh": "āsi，āsittha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3039-19-22", "zh": "āsiṃ，āsimha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3040-2-13", "zh": "“vā”与“asassa”也延续到下文。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3041-2-7", "zh": "501. 在非一切词根词尾（asabbadhātuka）之前，asa 变为 bhū。", "confidence": 70}
